    <article class="journey-card reveal"><div class="year">2009</div><hr><h3>Labour Contracting</h3><p>Our journey began with labour contracting, building a practical understanding of construction sites, workforce coordination and day-to-day execution.</p></article>
    <article class="journey-card reveal"><div class="year">Growth</div><hr><h3>Material Contracting</h3><p>With experience came greater responsibility. We expanded into material contracting and developed a broader understanding of construction operations.</p></article>
    <article class="journey-card featured reveal"><div class="year">VIHA</div><hr><h3>Building the Future</h3><p>The establishment of VIHA Group of Constructions marks the next stage of our journey, with a focus on quality, professional execution and lasting client relationships.</p></article>
