  <div class="reveal"><div class="eyebrow">Leadership & vision</div><h2 class="heading">Experience that<br><em>builds a vision.</em></h2>
    <p class="copy">With construction industry experience dating back to 2009, Mr. Balu Challa has built his professional journey from labour contracting to material contracting and now to establishing VIHA Group of Constructions.</p>
    <p class="copy">His journey reflects practical industry knowledge, dedication and a vision to build a construction company founded on quality, trust and professional excellence.</p>
    <p class="copy">His experience informs the company's emphasis on workmanship, responsible execution, teamwork and dependable construction services.</p>
